  "description": "Target-aware API-versioning helpers for Trellis.Asp. WithVersionedRoute() versions Location headers using the destination's actual mappings, including URL-segment pins. UseVersionedPageUrls() configures common PageUrl pagination builders through existing ASP options; typed PageUrl pins remain available. Pagination retains ambient segment routing and rejects explicit segment pins. Neutral and unversioned destinations skip injection.",
